{"step_index":167,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T10:46:59Z","thinking":"**Verifying System Route Status**\n\nAll routes return 200 OK, indicating successful endpoint operation. Now shifting focus to generating the `walkthrough.md` file, aiming to encapsulate the agent's actions and thought process. This artifact will document the executed changes comprehensively.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Detailed walkthrough of the NEXUS AI-powered criminal network analysis dashboard frontend implementation and verification results.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# NEXUS // Criminal Network Analysis Intelligence Dashboard\\n\\nNEXUS is an AI-powered criminal network analysis frontend designed for law enforcement and intelligence task forces. Built with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, React Router, and tactical UI primitives inspired by Palantir Gotham, Analyst's Notebook, and Maltego.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Workspace Location\\nThe complete frontend project has been created and verified at:\\n`C:\\\\Users\\\\Nityam Jaiswal\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\nexus`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Key Features & Completed Pages\\n\\n### 1. Login (`/login`)\\n- **Law-Enforcement Gate**: Title 18 U.S.C. § 1030 warning header with real-time AES-256 link status.\\n- **Officer Credentials**: Badge ID (`FED-8491`), encrypted hardware token PIN, and division selector (Transnational Crime, Cyber Warfare, Anti-Money Laundering, INTERPOL).\\n- **Biometric Simulation**: Live hardware token validation sequence.\\n- **Evaluation Profiles**: One-click quick-login triggers for \\\"Lead Investigator Sarah Vance\\\" and \\\"SIGINT Analyst\\\".\\n\\n### 2. Dashboard (`/`)\\n- **Command Center Telemetry**: Real-time status indicators with DEFCON-3 alert badge and sector telemetry.\\n- **Tactical KPI Metric Cards**:\\n  - *Active High-Value Targets* (42 HVTs with sparkline)\\n  - *Tracked Illicit Financial Flow* ($148.6M across 16 jurisdictions)\\n  - *Live Intercept Feeds* (189 active feeds)\\n  - *AI Anomaly Threat Index* (84.2 with neural recalculation)\\n- **Embedded Network Topology Radar**: Live interactive canvas showing the active criminal syndicate cluster for *Operation Phantom Web*.\\n- **Priority Intercept Stream**: Triage alert feed with AI confidence metrics, source identifiers (SIGINT, FINCEN, ANPR), and plot actions.\\n- **Active Operations Table**: Multi-jurisdictional case table with sorting, search, and status pills.\\n\\n### 3. Cases & Warrants (`/cases`)\\n- **Case Management**: Filter by status (*Active Investigation*, *Interdiction Imminent*, *Surveillance Phase*, *Grand Jury*) and priority (*CRITICAL*, *HIGH*, *MEDIUM*).\\n- \n<truncated 6723 bytes>","Description":"\"Create walkthrough.md documentation for NEXUS dashboard\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Nityam Jaiswal\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\fb69bf55-26d8-4420-a8a5-e461b2943c07\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating walkthrough artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Create walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
{"step_index":168,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T10:47:10Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-07T16:17:10+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-07T16:17:12+05:30\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fb69bf55-26d8-4420-a8a5-e461b2943c07/walkthrough.md with requested content.\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission."}
{"step_index":169,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T10:47:12Z","content":"The frontend for **NEXUS**, the AI-powered criminal network analysis dashboard, has been built, tested, and is currently running live.\n\n### Project Workspace\nThe project is located at:\n`C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\nexus`\n\n---\n\n### Key Highlights & Features\n\n1. **Law-Enforcement Intelligence Aesthetic**:\n   - High-density data displays, security classification headers (`TOP SECRET // SI // NOFORN`), tactical monospace coordinates, DEFCON indicators, and custom telemetry color accents.\n   - Dual theme support: Tactical Night Mode (default) and Analytical Day Mode with one-click toggling from the top navigation and settings.\n   - Purposeful, subtle micro-interactions with zero distracting animations.\n\n2. **All 8 Pages Implemented**:\n   - [**Login** (`/login`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx): Officer badge authentication (`FED-8491`), division selection, hardware token verification, and quick-login evaluation buttons.\n   - [**Dashboard** (`/`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/DashboardPage.tsx): Mission command center with 4 tactical KPI cards, live interactive syndicate topology radar, real-time intercept alert stream, and active cases table.\n   - [**Cases** (`/cases`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/CasesPage.tsx): Multi-jurisdiction case dossiers, warrant tracking, asset seizure tallies ($123.5M), search/priority filters, and a charter creation modal.\n   - [**Upload Evidence** (`/upload`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/UploadEvidencePage.tsx): Ingestion vault with automatic SHA-256 hash generation, chain of custody logging, 4-stage AI pipeline visualizer, and evidence card archive.\n   - [**Network Analysis** (`/network`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/NetworkAnalysisPage.tsx): Full-screen interactive graph workbench with canvas pan, zoom, node \n<truncated 654 bytes>\nvent stream correlating wiretaps, financial wires, ANPR sightings, and raids, filterable by target and category.\n   - [**Settings** (`/settings`)](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/pages/SettingsPage.tsx): AI anomaly and biometric confidence threshold sliders, theme switches, FIDO2 token status, and immutable CJIS audit logs.\n\n3. **All Required Reusable Components**:\n   - [Sidebar](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/layout/Sidebar.tsx)\n   - [TopNav](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/layout/TopNav.tsx)\n   - [MetricCard](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/MetricCard.tsx)\n   - [DataTable](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/DataTable.tsx)\n   - [NetworkGraphContainer](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/network/NetworkGraphContainer.tsx)\n   - [EvidenceCard](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/EvidenceCard.tsx)\n   - [EntityCard](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/EntityCard.tsx)\n   - [AlertCard](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/AlertCard.tsx)\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n\n- **Build**: `npm run build` compiled with **0 errors and 0 warnings** in 788ms.\n- **Dev Server**: Running on **`http://localhost:5173/`**.\n- **Route Status**:\n  - `GET /` ➔ **200 OK**\n  - `GET /login` ➔ **200 OK**\n  - `GET /cases` ➔ **200 OK**\n  - `GET /upload` ➔ **200 OK**\n  - `GET /network` ➔ **200 OK**\n  - `GET /entity/ent-1` ➔ **200 OK**\n  - `GET /timeline` ➔ **200 OK**\n  - `GET /settings` ➔ **200 OK**\n\nDetailed technical documentation is available in [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fb69bf55-26d8-4420-a8a5-e461b2943c07/walkthrough.md).","truncated_fields":["content"]}
