opNav.tsx`, `src/components/network/NetworkGraphContainer.tsx`, and `src/components/common/MetricCard.tsx`. `src/data/mockData.ts` holds the mock data to be replaced with Indian contexts. The other files contain the UI components needing simplification and branding updates.\n\n**Implementing UI Simplification and Branding**\n\nImplemented changes to the navigation bar within `Sidebar.tsx` to streamline links to five primary screens. Updated branding within `Sidebar.tsx` and `TopNav.tsx` to reflect \"SPECIAL CELL // DELHI POLICE\" and \"UP STF\" respectively. Also updated the search placeholder in `TopNav.tsx` with Indian names and vehicle formats.\n\n**Modifying Network Graph and Metrics**\n\nThe `NetworkGraphContainer.tsx` was adjusted to show six core nodes with clear labels and relationships. Simplified `MetricCard.tsx` to show the metrics consistent with Indian contexts. This ensures an uncluttered, more understandable visual representation.\n\n**Verifying Data Integration**\n\nReplaced the mock data within `src/data/mockData.ts` with Indian names, cities, vehicles, phone numbers, and INR amounts. Running the frontend application to verify that the UI components render the newly integrated data correctly. All existing functionality will be tested.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Inspection summary and technical implementation plan to simplify the NEXUS frontend for the Smart India Hackathon (SIH) prototype, featuring Indian sample data, simplified graph, 5 main screens, and Indian law enforcement context.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# NEXUS: Indian SIH Prototype Simplification Plan\\n\\nTransition the NEXUS criminal network analysis frontend prototype into an Indian law-enforcement intelligence tool tailored for a **Smart India Hackathon (SIH)** jury demonstration.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Codebase Inspection Summary\\n\\n### 1. File Containing Mock Data\\n- **[`src/data/mockDa